<title>NETHERLANDS: MANAGEMENT SHARE RAISES 1996 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>MANAGEMENT SHARE RAISES 1996 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.11 vs   0.05</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.7  vs   0.3</p>
<p>    Turnover				12.0  vs  10.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.5  vs   0.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Computer software and services company Management</p>
<p>Share NV said its provisional 1996 results were in line with</p>
<p>previous expectations. Final full-year results will be published</p>
<p>on April 1.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
